@Tenisu.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5287

### Health check
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/healthcheck

### All players, best first (default sort)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players
Accept: application/json

### All players, explicit sort
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players?sort=BestFirst
Accept: application/json

### Unknown sort (400 validation problem)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players?sort=42
Accept: application/json

### Known player
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players/52
Accept: application/json

### Unknown player (404 problem)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players/999
Accept: application/json

### Non-numeric id (404 from routing)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players/abc
